{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/positive-negative-integers/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/positive-negative-integers.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Positive & Negative Integers | Mathematics","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -arrow-left mr-2\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>Back to Foundations</a></nav>\n    \n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 md:p-8\">\n      <header class=\"mb-6 border-b pb-4\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Positive &amp; Negative Integers</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Master the fundamental operations with positive and negative integers - a crucial foundation for algebra and advanced mathematics.</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -bullseye mr-2\" data-mi=\"adjust\">adjust</span>Learning Objectives</h3>\n        <ul class=\"text-sm text-blue-700 space-y-1\">\n          <li>• Understand and represent integers on a number line</li>\n          <li>• Compare and order integers (including absolute value)</li>\n          <li>• Perform addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division with integers</li>\n          <li>• Apply integer operations to solve real-world problems</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section 1: Introduction to Integers -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">1</span>\n          What are Integers?\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Integers are whole numbers that can be positive, negative, or zero. They do not include fractions or decimals.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4 text-center\">\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-lg text-gray-800\">Integers = {..., -3, -2, -1, 0, 1, 2, 3, ...}</p>\n          <div class=\"flex justify-center gap-4 mt-3\">\n            <span class=\"bg-red-100 text-red-700 px-3 py-1 rounded\">Negative Integers</span>\n            <span class=\"bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded\">Zero</span>\n            <span class=\"bg-green-100 text-green-700 px-3 py-1 rounded\">Positive Integers</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Number Line Visual -->\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-3\">The Number Line</h4>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 80\" class=\"w-full h-20\">\n            <!-- Line -->\n            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>\n            <!-- Arrow -->\n            <polygon points=\"570,40 560,35 560,45\" fill=\"#374151\"></polygon>\n            <polygon points=\"30,40 40,35 40,45\" fill=\"#374151\"></polygon>\n            <!-- Tick marks and numbers -->\n            <g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n              <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"90\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#dc2626\">-5</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"140\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"140\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#dc2626\">-4</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"190\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"190\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#dc2626\">-3</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"240\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#dc2626\">-2</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"290\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"290\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#dc2626\">-1</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"340\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"2\"></line>\n              <text x=\"340\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#374151\" font-weight=\"bold\">0</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"390\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"390\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#16a34a\">1</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"440\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"440\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#16a34a\">2</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"490\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"490\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#16a34a\">3</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"540\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></line>\n              <text x=\"540\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#16a34a\">4</text>\n            </g>\n          </svg>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 text-center mt-2\">Numbers increase as you move right, decrease as you move left</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Key Concept -->\n        <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-yellow-800 mb-1\"><span class=\"mi -lightbulb mr-2\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span>Key Concept</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-700\">Numbers further to the RIGHT on the number line are GREATER. Numbers further to the LEFT are SMALLER.</p>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-700 mt-1\">Example: -2 is greater than -5 (because -2 is to the right of -5 on the number line)</p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 2: Absolute Value -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">2</span>\n          Absolute Value\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">The absolute value of a number is its distance from zero on the number line, regardless of direction. It is always positive or zero.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4 text-center\">\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-lg text-gray-800\">|a| = the absolute value of a</p>\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded\">\n              <p class=\"font-mono text-xl text-purple-600\">|-5| = 5</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Distance from 0 is 5 units</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded\">\n              <p class=\"font-mono text-xl text-purple-600\">|7| = 7</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Distance from 0 is 7 units</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 3: Addition and Subtraction -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">3</span>\n          Addition and Subtraction Rules\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -plus mr-2\" data-mi=\"add\">add</span>Addition Rules</h4>\n            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2\">\n              <li><strong>Same signs:</strong> Add the absolute values, keep the sign</li>\n              <li class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded\">(-3) + (-5) = -8</li>\n              <li><strong>Different signs:</strong> Subtract the smaller absolute value from the larger, keep the sign of the larger</li>\n              <li class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded\">(-7) + 4 = -3</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -minus mr-2\" data-mi=\"remove\">remove</span>Subtraction Rule</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\"><strong>Key:</strong> Subtracting is the same as adding the opposite!</p>\n            <ul class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2\">\n              <li class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded\">8 - (-3) = 8 + 3 = 11</li>\n              <li class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded\">-5 - 7 = -5 + (-7) = -12</li>\n              <li class=\"font-mono bg-white p-2 rounded\">-2 - (-6) = -2 + 6 = 4</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-blue-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Complex Addition</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Calculate -15 + 8 - (-12) + (-5)</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Convert all subtractions to additions</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">-15 + 8 + 12 + (-5)</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Group positive and negative numbers</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  Positive: 8 + 12 = 20<br>\n                  Negative: -15 + (-5) = -20\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add the results</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">20 + (-20) = 0</div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 0</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 4: Multiplication and Division -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">4</span>\n          Multiplication and Division Rules\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3 text-center\">Sign Rules for Multiplication and Division</h4>\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"bg-green-100 p-3 rounded\">\n              <p class=\"font-mono text-lg\">(+)(+) = +</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600\">Pos × Pos = Pos</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-green-100 p-3 rounded\">\n              <p class=\"font-mono text-lg\">(-)(-) = +</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600\">Neg × Neg = Pos</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-red-100 p-3 rounded\">\n              <p class=\"font-mono text-lg\">(+)(-) = -</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600\">Pos × Neg = Neg</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-red-100 p-3 rounded\">\n              <p class=\"font-mono text-lg\">(-)(+) = -</p>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600\">Neg × Pos = Neg</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-1\"><span class=\"mi -lightbulb mr-2\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span>Memory Tip</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-blue-700\"><strong>\"Same signs = Positive, Different signs = Negative\"</strong></p>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-blue-700 mt-1\">Like signs attract (become positive), unlike signs repel (become negative)!</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Examples -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-orange-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Order of Operations</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Calculate -3 × (4 - 7) + 5</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Solve inside the brackets first (BODMAS)</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">(4 - 7) = -3</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Perform the multiplication</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">-3 × (-3) = 9</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Complete the addition</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">9 + 5 = 14</div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 14</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Division Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-orange-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Division</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Calculate (-48) ÷ (-6)</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Apply the sign rule:</strong> Negative ÷ Negative = Positive</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">(-48) ÷ (-6) = 48 ÷ 6 = 8</div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 8</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 5: Real World Applications -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -globe text-teal-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"public\">public</span>\n          Real-World Applications\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-blue-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -temperature-low mr-2\" data-mi=\"device_thermostat\">device_thermostat</span>Temperature</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Temperatures can be positive (above freezing) or negative (below freezing).</p>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 font-mono\">If it's -5°C and rises by 8°C: -5 + 8 = 3°C</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -money-bill mr-2\" data-mi=\"payments\">payments</span>Banking</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Positive = deposits/credits, Negative = withdrawals/debts</p>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 font-mono\">Account: -₦500 + ₦1000 = +₦500</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-purple-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -mountain mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Elevation</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Above sea level = positive, Below sea level = negative</p>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\">Dead Sea: -430m, Mt. Everest: +8,849m</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-orange-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -football-ball mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Sports</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Goal difference: Goals scored (positive) vs. conceded (negative)</p>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 font-mono\">+15 - 8 = +7 goal difference</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Interactive Practice -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -calculator text-teal-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>\n          Interactive Practice\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-teal-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-teal-200\">\n          <p class=\"text-center text-gray-700 mb-4\">Solve each problem and check your answer:</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">1. Calculate: (-8) ÷ 2 + |-3|</p>\n              <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice1\" placeholder=\"Your answer\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n                <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-teal-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-teal-700\">Check</button>\n              </div>\n              <p id=\"feedback1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">2. Order from smallest to largest: -1, 3, 0, -5, 2</p>\n              <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice2\" placeholder=\"e.g., -5, -1, 0, 2, 3\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n                <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-teal-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-teal-700\">Check</button>\n              </div>\n              <p id=\"feedback2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">3. Calculate: (-4) × (-3) - 10</p>\n              <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice3\" placeholder=\"Your answer\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n                <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-teal-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-teal-700\">Check</button>\n              </div>\n              <p id=\"feedback3\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-lg\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">4. Evaluate: 15 - (-7) + (-4)</p>\n              <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n                <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice4\" placeholder=\"Your answer\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n                <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-teal-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-teal-700\">Check</button>\n              </div>\n              <p id=\"feedback4\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Summary -->\n      <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-green-100 to-teal-100 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\"><span class=\"mi -clipboard-list mr-2\" data-mi=\"fact_check\">fact_check</span>Quick Reference Rules</h3>\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-green-700 mb-2\">Addition</p>\n            <p>• Same signs: Add and keep sign</p>\n            <p>• Different signs: Subtract, use sign of larger absolute value</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2\">Subtraction</p>\n            <p>• Change subtraction to addition of opposite</p>\n            <p>• a - b = a + (-b)</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-2\">Multiplication</p>\n            <p>• Same signs = Positive result</p>\n            <p>• Different signs = Negative result</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700 mb-2\">Division</p>\n            <p>• Same signs = Positive result</p>\n            <p>• Different signs = Negative result</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);} .accordion-content{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.3s ease-out;}.accordion-content.open{max-height:2000px;}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}